      "html": "<div data-v-d1e1d890><section id=\"section-aia-hero\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative justify-center min-h-viewport-min max-md:min-h-viewport-stable-min pb-24 max-md:pb-10 section-shell--nav-clearance section-shell--nav-clearance-with-padding section-shell--fluid-mobile-padding pointer-events-auto\" style=\"--section-shell-padding-top:6rem;--section-shell-padding-top-mobile:2.5rem;\" data-v-d1e1d890 data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-8\" data-v-d1e1d890><div class=\"max-w-4xl flex flex-col gap-4\" data-v-d1e1d890><h1 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-5xl max-md:leading-none max-md:tracking-display text-6xl\" data-v-d1e1d890><span class=\"block text-spark\">AI agency</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">London.</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">Automation, agents &amp; software.</span></h1></div><p class=\"max-md:text-xl max-md:leading-7 text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight max-w-6xl text-slatecolor\" data-v-d1e1d890>An AI agency for scale-ups and enterprises: automation that removes repetitive work, agents that connect your tools and data, and AI-native software built by small, senior, embedded squads. We hire and manage the engineers; they work in your standups and your codebase, so you own what ships.</p></div></section></div>"
