      "html": "<section id=\"section-aia-stats\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-24 max-md:py-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"grid w-full grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-md:grid-cols-1\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"h-full w-full ui-glass ui-glass--chalk ui-glass--edge-rounded\" data-v-fb63fbe4><div class=\"ui-glass__content\" data-v-fb63fbe4></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-3 p-8\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">64%</p><p class=\"text-base leading-snug text-slatecolor/70\">time saved against the sampled manual workflow, with our Google Cloud sales agent. The agent has 5,000 monthly active users</p></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"h-full w-full ui-glass ui-glass--chalk ui-glass--edge-rounded\" data-v-fb63fbe4><div class=\"ui-glass__content\" data-v-fb63fbe4></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-3 p-8\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">4 weeks to days</p><p class=\"text-base leading-snug text-slatecolor/70\">Tesco's retail-ad approval cycle, after our AI creative studio</p></div></div><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"h-full w-full ui-glass ui-glass--chalk ui-glass--edge-rounded\" data-v-fb63fbe4><div class=\"ui-glass__content\" data-v-fb63fbe4></div></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-3 p-8\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-slatecolor\">78%</p><p class=\"text-base leading-snug text-slatecolor/70\">Upstix's operating cost reduction with instant AI house valuations</p></div></div></div></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human",
        "data-v-c2ba827a": ""
      },
      "html": "<section id=\"section-aia-intro\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-24 max-md:py-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-prose flex-col gap-11 text-left\" data-v-c2ba827a><h2 class=\"font-normal tracking-tight max-md:text-3xl max-md:leading-9 text-4xl\" data-v-c2ba827a><span class=\"block text-spark\">What we do</span><span class=\"block text-slatecolor\">An AI agency in London for automation, agents &amp; AI-native software</span></h2><div class=\"body-content body-content--markdown flex flex-col text-lg leading-relaxed text-slatecolor prose-body\" data-v-c2ba827a data-v-34ac1b0d><p>Fyntix is an AI agency based in Southwark, London. We work as an AI automation agency, an AI agent development company, and an AI software development company - three capabilities, one embedded team, no handoffs between them.</p>\n<p>Most AI agencies specialise in one of these: automating a workflow, shipping a chatbot, or building software. We do all three because the best AI work usually needs all three - an automation only pays off if it's built on software that can hold it, and an agent is only useful once it's connected to real tools and data.</p>\n<p>As an <strong>AI automation agency</strong>, we find the repetitive, manual work slowing your team down and remove it - from creative approvals to data entry to customer operations. Comparing automation partners? See our shortlist of the <a href=\"/feed/best-ai-automation-agencies-uk-2026\">best AI automation agencies in the UK</a>. As an <strong>AI agent development company</strong>, we build agentic systems that connect your tools, data and workflows so agents can act, not just answer questions - see our dedicated <a href=\"/services/ai-agent-development\">AI agent development services</a> for custom agent builds and integration work. And as an <strong>AI software development company</strong>, we ship the production-grade platforms and applications that automation and agents run on. Explore our full <a href=\"/services\">AI consultancy &amp; product development services</a>.</p>\n<p>We work with scale-ups and global enterprises alike - small senior squads, startup pace, enterprise-grade delivery. Prefer to build in-house with senior engineers embedded in your own team? See our <a href=\"/services/forward-deployed-engineers\">forward-deployed engineers</a>. For the experience layer of AI-native software - agentic flows people trust and use daily - see our <a href=\"/services/ai-product-design\">AI product design services</a>. And if you're building a new product from scratch rather than automating or connecting an existing one, see our <a href=\"/services/digital-product-agency\">digital product agency services</a>. Still shortlisting? We reviewed the market in <a href=\"/feed/top-ai-development-companies-in-the-uk-2026\">top AI development companies in the UK</a> and <a href=\"/feed/best-ai-agencies-for-scale-ups-2026\">the best AI agencies for scale-ups</a>. Still deciding whether to use an agency at all? We set out the three options - build, buy or embed - in <a href=\"/feed/ai-agency-vs-in-house-build-buy-or-embed\">AI agency vs in-house</a>.</p>\n</div></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
