      "html": "<div class=\"w-full overflow-hidden bg-chalk\"><section id=\"section-aia-pillars\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative gap-40 pt-40 pb-20 max-md:pt-20 max-md:pb-10 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-1c6297c3><h2 class=\"font-normal text-5xl\"><span class=\"text-spark\">Automation, agents &amp; AI software</span><br><span class=\"text-slatecolor\">What an AI agency delivers, end to end - automation that removes work, agents that connect systems, and the software that holds it all together.</span></h2><div class=\"grid-cols-3 grid w-full max-md:grid-cols-1 items-stretch max-md:gap-16 gap-24\"><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">Automation</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Remove the repetitive work.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">We map the manual, repetitive processes costing your team the most time and automate them with AI - from content and creative approvals to data entry and back-office operations.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/tesco-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Tesco\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We built an AI-native creative studio that took Tesco's retail ads from four-week approvals to days.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">Agent development</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Systems that connect &amp; act.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Custom AI agents and agentic workflows built around your tools, data and business logic - designed to act on your behalf, not just answer questions.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/_nuxt/google-cloud-evidence._xZJoMAR.svg\" alt=\"Google Cloud\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We uncovered sales opportunities for 5,000 Googlers with an agentic sales system.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex h-full w-full flex-col items-start max-md:gap-6 gap-8\"><div class=\"relative max-md:size-80 size-72 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"pillar-particle-field pointer-events-auto relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing touch-none\"><span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start gap-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-1 flex-col items-start max-md:gap-10 gap-8\"><h3 class=\"text-spark font-normal text-5xl\">AI software development</h3><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-3xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Production-grade, from day one.</p><p class=\"text-haze-800 max-md:text-2xl max-md:leading-8 text-xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight\">Web and mobile applications, internal platforms, and enterprise software built AI-native from the start - engineered by embedded squads who ship working software from the first sprint.</p><div class=\"flex w-full items-center gap-4\"><img src=\"/content-media/clients/upstix-logo.gen.webp\" alt=\"Upstix\" class=\"size-12 shrink-0 object-contain\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"text-slatecolor text-lg font-normal leading-normal tracking-tight\">We shipped a property-selling app with instant AI-powered valuations for Upstix - in 7 days.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "class": "view-mode-section view-mode-section__branch view-mode-section__branch--human",
        "data-v-be4afccd": ""
      },
      "html": "<div class=\"w-full bg-chalk\" data-v-be4afccd><section id=\"section-aia-faq\" class=\"px-gutter max-md:px-gutter-mobile flex flex-col mx-auto w-full relative py-32 max-md:py-12 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"\" data-v-be4afccd data-v-1c6297c3><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-12\" data-v-be4afccd><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\" data-v-be4afccd><h2 class=\"font-normal text-5xl\" data-v-be4afccd><span class=\"text-spark\">AI agency FAQs</span></h2><p class=\"max-w-3xl text-xl leading-snug tracking-tight text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd>Straight answers for teams evaluating an AI agency in London.</p></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col\" data-v-be4afccd><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What is an AI agency? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>An AI agency helps businesses adopt artificial intelligence - typically some mix of automating existing processes, building custom AI agents, and developing AI-native software. Fyntix covers all three under one embedded team: AI automation, agent development, and AI software development.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What is the difference between an AI agency and an AI consultancy? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>An AI consultancy typically advises on strategy and stops at recommendations. An AI agency builds - it ships the automation, agents, or software it recommends. Fyntix does both: AI Launchpad workshops and proofs of concept for strategy, then embedded squads that build and ship.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>What does an AI automation agency actually automate? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>The repetitive, rules-based work slowing teams down - content and creative approvals, data entry, reporting, customer operations, and similar workflows. We map the highest-value processes first, then automate with AI rather than rigid scripts, so the automation adapts as the work changes.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How is Fyntix different from other AI development agencies? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Most AI development agencies specialise in one layer - automation, agents, or software. We combine all three in one embedded squad, backed by delivery experience spanning scale-ups and enterprises: Google, Tesco, Sage, Revolut, and Upstix. Small senior teams, startup pace, production quality.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Do you work with scale-ups as well as enterprises? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Yes. We work with ambitious scale-ups and global enterprises - from Upstix and Revolut to Google and Tesco. The engagement model adapts to your stage: discovery sprints and proofs of concept for early bets, embedded product squads for full automation, agent, or software builds.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How much does it cost to work with an AI agency? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>It depends on scope and engagement model. We typically start with a fixed-scope AI Launchpad workshop or proof of concept to validate value before a larger build, then move to an embedded squad for delivery. Get in touch for a scoped estimate.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>How do I choose an AI development agency? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Look for shipped evidence, not slide decks - ask what they've automated or built, who will actually work on your project, and how fast they get something real in front of users. Then start small: a Launchpad workshop or proof of concept reveals more than any pitch.</span></div></details><details class=\"faq-item group min-w-0\" data-v-be4afccd><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start justify-between gap-8 py-6 text-2xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-slatecolor\" data-v-be4afccd>Where is your AI agency based? <span class=\"faq-item__marker relative mt-2 block h-4 w-4 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-v-be4afccd></span></summary><div class=\"max-w-3xl pb-6 text-lg leading-snug text-haze-800\" data-v-be4afccd><span>Our HQ is in Southwark, London - The Binary, 27 Copperfield Street, SE1 0EN. We work with clients across the UK and internationally, from scale-ups to global enterprises.</span></div></details></div></div></section></div>"
    },
